  "question": {
    "text": "The mirror image of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, in a plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math> Which of the following points lies on this plane?",
