      "text": "<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>",
